      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "To convey 'Heritage/Legacy,' focus on multi-generational casting that suggests rootedness and classic European or established Anglo-American aesthetics, prioritizing timeless grooming and poise over overt trendiness. For the 'Urban Trendsetter,' authenticity comes from diverse, globally-aware casting who actively participate in contemporary cultural scenes, showing varying levels of self-curation. The key difference should be the *narrative*: Legacy embodies inherited status, while Urban embodies performed, chosen cultural relevance.",
